                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "15494942-59c2-3895-8b01-43b282c1c859",
                        "entry_id": "afefd7f3-02ae-322a-b7e9-c02a769d178f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Lacking substance; insubstantial."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "70eb7ecb-49d2-46ab-990b-76dd5d55d023",
                                "sense_id": "15494942-59c2-3895-8b01-43b282c1c859",
                                "text": "He thought of his parents and Mary with the tenderness of separation, and felt ashamed because he had neglected his mother's letter for this unknown, unsubstantiate Martha's."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c2fce00-abd9-4da9-8dc8-7398187f48a6",
                                "sense_id": "15494942-59c2-3895-8b01-43b282c1c859",
                                "text": "He steps over from Divinity unsubstantiate to spiritual substance just as he once descended into the world of matter."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf4d70c2-53dc-43e6-985e-ce7bd21b5ef1",
                                "sense_id": "15494942-59c2-3895-8b01-43b282c1c859",
                                "text": "The froth bubbling on, at the surface, is merely the run of the cotton, soft and unsubstantiate."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1e480827-670e-355d-8576-be106b6e00a2",
                        "entry_id": "afefd7f3-02ae-322a-b7e9-c02a769d178f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Unsubstantiated; unproven."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9fcaf1e0-0804-4b6c-ae6e-7101cd4b05a2",
                                "sense_id": "1e480827-670e-355d-8576-be106b6e00a2",
                                "text": "This, however, was a case where the defendant (described in the file as a possible “fly-by-nighter”) made a quite unsubstantiate claim for the goods he was selling."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b02d87e5-ab4c-4fec-830e-df2ed532048d",
                                "sense_id": "1e480827-670e-355d-8576-be106b6e00a2",
                                "text": "The unsubstantiate slanders made by Teng Hsiao-p'ing can only expose his rapacious design of trying to reverse verdicts, settle accounts and carry out restoration."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9e04ab72-ec9a-4ee2-bced-4b84e20462e2",
                                "sense_id": "1e480827-670e-355d-8576-be106b6e00a2",
                                "text": "Iran responds to unsubstantiate accusations by the New York Times that Iran hired five Russian scientists from Russia and Kazakhstan;"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
